### 0. 불편함 목록 (id 확인용, 로그인 없이 가능)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/problems

### 1. 로그인
# @name login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv TEST_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv TEST_PASSWORD}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 불편함 등록 (필요할 때만, 누를 때마다 글이 하나씩 생김)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/problems
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "택배 도착 알림이 너무 늦어요", "content": "문 앞에 놓인 지 1시간 뒤에야 알림이 와요", "category": "편의·복지" }

### 2. 프로젝트 등록 (누를 때마다 프로젝트가 하나씩 생김)
# @name newProject
POST http://localhost:4000/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "공지 모아보기", "description": "학부 공지를 한곳에", "related_problem_id": 34 }

###
@pid = {{newProject.response.body.id}}

### 3. 진행률·예정일·배포 주소 수정
PATCH http://localhost:4000/api/projects/{{pid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "progress": 40, "progress_started_on": "2026-11-19", "expected_completion_date": "2026-11-23", "deployment_url": "https://example.com" }

### 4. 불편함 기준 조회
GET http://localhost:4000/api/projects?related_problem_id=34
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. 의견 등록
# @name newFeedback
POST http://localhost:4000/api/projects/{{pid}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "써 보니 편해요" }

###
@fid = {{newFeedback.response.body.id}}

### 6. 의견 공감
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/projects/{{pid}}/feedback/{{fid}}/reaction
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reaction": "like" }

### 7. 상세 조회 (반응 수 확인)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/projects/{{pid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 마이페이지 (형 API)
GET http://localhost:4000/api/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
